        "description": {
          "ko": "2125년 능선 초계 중 매복 흔적을 먼저 읽어 피해를 막았다.",
          "en": "In 2125, on a ridge patrol, he read the ambush traces first and prevented the harm. By this deed the signature of the power installation patrol post rose into the ledger."
